#: scenario7:scenario7_BF92EEC8_A75F_41EE_A68E_28898B4C2626
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ba9ad26698e18e76137f96b1e8d70114844720faedd92ef14048660d6d632f15
